{% comment %}
  "Build your own gift set" picker for the Customize Trio gift-set products
  — Customize Gift Set 35ml/65ml/100ml (handles blended-35-ml / blended-65-ml
  / blended-100-ml). Burhan, 2026-09-25: "there are 2 perfumes and 1 attar
  roll on ... it will be one price no discounts etc."

  Each gift-set product is a single fixed-price, single-variant ("Default
  Title") product — the price never changes no matter which fragrances are
  picked. So unlike Customize Perfume (which drives a real 594-variant
  product), the customer's 3 choices here (2 perfume fragrances and 1
  roll-on fragrance) are captured as line-item properties on that one
  variant, submitted through the page's own <product-form> exactly like any
  other named field in that form — no separate /cart/add call, no
  bundle/discount-function machinery, nothing for
  assets/customize-trio-picker.js to add to the cart itself. It only gates
  the buy buttons until all 3 are chosen (Burhan asked picking be required,
  same as product-gift-picker.liquid's own required gate) — see that file's
  getBuyButtons()/updateBuyButtons() pattern, mirrored here.

  Burhan, 2026-09-26: removed the per-perfume Type (Alcoholic/Non-Alcoholic)
  field entirely, and made the three fragrance fields reveal one at a time —
  Perfume 2 only appears once Perfume 1 has a fragrance picked, and the
  Attar Roll-On field only appears once Perfume 2 does. Each
  `.customize-trio-picker__field-group` after the first renders with
  `hidden` and a `data-trio-group` index; assets/customize-trio-picker.js's
  `revealNextGroup()` clears `hidden` on the next group once the current
  group's fragrance field has a checked radio.

  Deliberately NOT rendering the free-gift picker's offer on these products:
  a gift set already contains 2 full perfumes and a roll-on, so an extra
  free 35ml perfume on top doesn't make sense (Burhan, 2026-09-25: "i need
  no complementary 35ml bottle of free roll on"). No special-case was needed
  to suppress it — these products were never in the free-gift qualifying
  collection or added to the handle-exception list used elsewhere (see
  sections/main-product.liquid's product_gift_eligible), so
  snippets/product-gift-picker.liquid's own eligibility check already
  no-ops here on its own. This comment exists so a future session doesn't
  "fix" that as an oversight and add the exception by mistake.

  Accepts:
  - section_id: {String}

  Usage:
  {% render 'customize-trio-picker', section_id: section.id %}
{% endcomment %}
{%- liquid
  assign perfume_source = all_products['customize-perfume-1']
  assign rollon_source = all_products['customize-attar']
  assign product_form_id = 'product-form-' | append: section_id
-%}
<customize-trio-picker
  class="customize-trio-picker"
  data-section="{{ section_id }}"
  data-product-form-id="{{ product_form_id }}"
>
  <p class="customize-trio-picker__heading">Build Your Gift Set</p>
  <p class="customize-trio-picker__subtext">Choose 2 perfumes and 1 attar roll-on to include.</p>

  <div class="customize-trio-picker__field-group" data-trio-group="1">
    <p class="customize-trio-picker__field-group-heading">Perfume 1</p>
    {% render 'customize-trio-fragrance-field',
      source_product: perfume_source,
      field_key: 'Perfume 1 Fragrance',
      field_label: 'Fragrance',
      product_form_id: product_form_id,
      section_id: section_id
    %}
  </div>

  <div class="customize-trio-picker__field-group" data-trio-group="2" hidden>
    <p class="customize-trio-picker__field-group-heading">Perfume 2</p>
    {% render 'customize-trio-fragrance-field',
      source_product: perfume_source,
      field_key: 'Perfume 2 Fragrance',
      field_label: 'Fragrance',
      product_form_id: product_form_id,
      section_id: section_id
    %}
  </div>

  <div class="customize-trio-picker__field-group" data-trio-group="3" hidden>
    <p class="customize-trio-picker__field-group-heading">Attar Roll-On</p>
    {% render 'customize-trio-fragrance-field',
      source_product: rollon_source,
      field_key: 'Attar Roll-On Fragrance',
      field_label: 'Fragrance',
      product_form_id: product_form_id,
      section_id: section_id
    %}
  </div>

  <p class="customize-trio-picker__required-hint" data-trio-required-hint hidden>
    *Choose all 3 fragrances above before you can add this gift set to your cart.
  </p>
</customize-trio-picker>
